# Ignore everything
*

# =============================================================================
# Large-file safeguards (2026-05-13)
# Background: 3x160MB .safetensors files in adapters/claudine-v1/ committed
# under b02e8243 blocked a push to GitHub (100MB hard limit). Large training
# artifacts and binary blobs are ignored by default. Approved payloads may be
# force-added only when covered by narrow Git LFS rules in .gitattributes.
# Existing tracked files remain tracked — .gitignore only affects untracked
# paths. This guards against future accidental raw-Git adds.
# =============================================================================

# Specific directories
adapters/
**/checkpoints/

# ML model weights & training artifacts
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.h5
*.gguf
*.onnx
*.msgpack
*.npz
*.npy

# Extension installer packages
*.vsix

# Embedded databases (corpus / index / cache)
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-journal

