# Lens manifests follow the naming convention <name>_index.{json,md}.
# Glob allows any current or future lens to auto-track without per-lens
# edits — convention is the contract. Files that don't follow the
# convention (experiments, drafts) stay gitignored by default, which is
# the right safety posture.
!manifest/*_index.json
!manifest/*_index.md

# CI membrane + memory manifests (2026-05-27). Audit snapshots from
# ci/checks/*.ts and the time-series diary written by canon-drift-snapshot.
# Same gitignore-as-contract pattern: <name>_audit.json glob auto-tracks any
# future audit lens; *_history.ndjson glob tracks the diary tier.
!manifest/*_audit.json
!manifest/*_history.ndjson

