# Allow Reconciliation Engine bilateral covenant artifacts (2026-05-25)
# Per GOVERNANCE_RECONCILIATION_ENGINE_V1_CLAUDE / _V1_CODEX
# Parent-dir negations required before per-file negations — git cannot re-include
# files under an excluded parent (.temple/protocols/, game/lore/characters/).
# MAILBOX_PROTOCOL.md was working-tree-only prior to 2026-05-25; D4 brings it
# into tracking so the verify_with: convention section commits alongside the tome.
# Character JSONs reorganized 2026-05-27 into <organ>/<tier>/ per SSOT §295-326
# Organ-Level Entity Canon. Schema-validated against character.schema.json.
